      "description": "Partners - Nubo Skip to content Get Your Free Trial Company Our History Leadership Partners Support Blog News & Events Request Demo Free Trial Menu Company Support News & Events Blog Request Demo Product The Future for Mobile Enterprises is Now What is Virtual Mobile Infrastructure (VMI) How it Works HTML5 Support Key Features Integration Solutions PrivateFone Spyware-Proof Mobile Device High-Security Mobility Mobile App Virtualization PrivateFone Spyware Protection Mobility as a Service Why Nubo? Benefits UX over IP: The Difference is in the Performance VMI Vs. EMM Industries Defense Finance Healthcare Resources Nubo VMI Product Brochure Security White Paper System Architecture POC Requirements End User Guide Admin API Join us in Moving Mobility Forward Re-define your customer’s mobility capabilities into the next generation through Nubo’s managed mobile service platform. Help your customers radically simplify mobility management while accelerating app adoption with intelligence-grade security right out of the box! Our History Leadership Partners Join us in Moving Mobility Forward Re-define your customer’s mobility capabilities into the next generation through Nubo’s managed mobile service platform. Help your customers radically simplify mobility management while accelerating app adoption with intelligence-grade security right out of the box! Channel Partners Nubo’s innovative VMI technology offers new, market-making partnership opportunities for leading resellers and consulting firms, integrators and technology partners. Mobility as a service offers new revenue opportunities capitalizing on the shift from devices to the Cloud for mobile app and security enablement. Resellers Nubo VMI is a uniquely complimentary solution to traditional infrastructure security offerings. Attaching Nubo VMI technology to security infrastructure programs provides added relevancy for clients by helping them close their mobile threat perimeter to zero by leveraging Nubo’s “Zero Data on Device” operating model. Integrators Mobility security enablement is an area of significant attention by CIOs and CISOs. Mobile devices represent a major area of threat from malware and ransomware perpetrators. How to reduce mobile threat perimeters to zero is a major opportunity area for integrators by extending current security infrastructure to encapsulate mobile devices. Nubo VMI offers a next-generation technology approach that aligns perfectly with current security infrastructure programs and ensures control and security over enterprise data and intellectual property. Managed Service Providers Mobility as a Service (MaaS) is a new and innovative mobile service delivery model that is completely supported by Nubo VMI’s multi-tenant mobile virtualization platform. Moving mobile app and security delivery from devices to a Cloud MaaS model, radically changes the economics, security, management and user experience. Virtual Desktop Infrastructure (VDI) changed the game forever for PCs; Virtual Mobile Infrastructure (VMI) will similarly change how mobile experiences are built, secured, deployed, managed and evolved from the Cloud to devices. This represents a tremendous business opportunity for MSPs globally. Benefits of Becoming a Nubo Channel Partner: Comprehensive marketing, sales, field and enablement support Margin-rich software, consulting, enablement and managed service sales opportunities Access to new products and software releases Targeted and sustained lead generation programs Flexible programs for dedicated distributors as well as reference sales Current Strategic Partners For more information on our partnership opportunities, complete the form below and we will get in touch. “Partner Application Form” . . . Nubo AI Agents Mobile Devices Linux Remote Desktop About Us Careers Leadership Privacy & Terms Contact Us Follow Us Contact Us sales@nubosoftware.com Phone: +1-617-500-1902 Phone: +972-55-966-1496 Copyright © 2025, Nubo Software L