      "description": "Nubo AI Agents - Intelligent Cybersecurity Threat Detection Your Security Team Just Got an Upgrade: AI Agents Stop drowning in data. Deploy intelligent AI Agents that don't just watch users—they understand intent , detect threats , and tell you exactly what matters . Watch a Live Demo Request a Live Trial AI Agent Detection in Progress... [INFO] User j.doe accessing CRM database... [INFO] File download initiated: customer_list.csv... [INFO] USB device connected... [THREAT DETECTED] Potential data exfiltration - High confidence [AI AGENT] Context: Employee accessing customer data outside normal pattern, downloading to external device during off-hours From Alert Fatigue to Actionable Intelligence See how AI Agents transform your security operations from reactive chaos to proactive clarity. Before: Data Overload Stressed Analyst Buried under thousands of alerts, struggling to identify real threats in the noise. Endless, noisy logs Thousands of false positives Hours of manual investigation Threats slip through undetected After: AI Agent Clarity Empowered Team Human expertise enhanced by AI intelligence, focusing only on verified threats. Cognitive Agents see and understand user actions Analyst Agents reason and identify true threats Investigator Agents answer questions in seconds Perfect clarity on what matters Chaos Before AI Agents → Clarity With AI Agents An AI Security Workforce on Day One We deploy a team of specialized AI Agents that work 24/7 to protect you from insider threats. Each agent brings unique capabilities to detect, analyze, and investigate threats. The Observer Agent Your Eyes on Every Endpoint Our front-line agent. It uses Cognitive Vision to watch user screens and actions, understanding context like \"downloading customer lists\" or \"accessing production code.\" AI-Powered Vision interprets on-screen activity Automatically classifies user interactions Privacy-by-design with PII anonymization Context-aware monitoring beyond traditional UAM The Analyst Agent Your 24/7 Reasoning Engine The brains of the operation. This reasoning agent analyzes the Observer's findings, thinks like an elite security professional, and flags sophisticated threats that rules-based systems always miss. Autonomous threat hunting across timelines High-fidelity alerts with zero false positives Dynamic behavioral baselining per user MITRE ATT&CK framework integration The Investigator Agent Your Conversational Co-Pilot Your on-demand research partner. This chatbot agent lets your team ask plain-English questions to instantly investigate past incidents, cutting down manual effort by 95%. Natural language investigation queries Instant historical data analysis AI-generated incident summaries Ready-to-report threat narratives Explore the AI Agent Platform 3 AI Agents 24/7 Monitoring ∞ Scale The AI Agent Platform : A Deep Dive Go beyond passive monitoring. Our platform is an active security workforce composed of three specialized AI Agents designed to autonomously detect, analyze, and help you investigate insider threats. 1. The Observer Agent Your Eyes on Every Endpoint The Observer Agent is the foundation of our platform, providing unparalleled, context-aware monitoring. It sees and understands activity in a way no traditional UAM can. AI-Powered Vision Uses a vision-based LLM to interpret on-screen activity. It knows the difference between a user writing code in an IDE versus copying a customer list from a CRM. Action Classification Automatically labels user interactions (data_exfiltration_to_usb, code_commit_to_personal_repo, sensitive_file_compression) for the Analyst Agent. Privacy-by-Design Can be configured to automatically anonymize PII on-screen, ensuring you analyze risk without compromising employee privacy. Screen Analysis: → CRM interface detected → Customer data visible → Export action initiated → USB device connected 2. The Analyst Agent Your 24/7 Reasoning Engine This is your master threat detector. The Analyst Agent receives structured data from the entire fleet of Observer Agents and uses a powerful reasoning LLM, fine-tuned on cybersecurity frameworks like MITRE ATT&CK, to think like a human expert. Autonomous Threat Hunting Connects seemingly unrelated, low-risk events across a timeline to uncover sophisticated attack patterns. High-Fidelity Alerts Eliminates false positives by understanding the intent and context behind actions. Alerts are delivered as concise, human-readable incident reports. Dynamic Behavioral Baselining Learns what's normal for every user and role, making anomaly detection incredibly precise and effective. Multi-source correlation active Behavioral analysis: 340% deviation MITRE ATT&CK: T1041 detected ALERT: Data exfiltration sequence 3. The Investigator Agent Your Conversational Co-Pilot Slash investigation time from hours to seconds. The Investigator Agent is a powerful chatbot integrated directly into the platform, giving your security team instant access to historical data through natural language. Ask Anything, Get Answers Instantly: \"Show me all file uploads to cloud storage from the finance department this month.\" \"Generate a timeline of user 'j.doe's activity on the day of the security incident.\" \"Did anyone access the production database outside of business hours last week?\" AI-Generated Incident Summaries Ask the agent to summarize any alert, and it provides a clear, concise narrative of the event, ready for reporting. You: \"Show me suspicious activity for user j.doe last week\" AI Agent: Found 3 anomalies: Off-hours database access (2x), unusual file download pattern, VPN from new location. Real-World Use Cases Detecting Malicious Insiders The Analyst Agent spots the subtle TTPs of a malicious employee, from initial reconnaissance to final data exfiltration. Preventing Accidental Data Loss The Observer Agent identifies when a well-meaning employee mishandles sensitive data, allowing for proactive intervention and training. Identifying Compromised Accounts Th",
